# Deny by default; add new config explicitly below. The checkout no longer
# lives in ~/.claude, but the rule stays: it keeps test artifacts, editor
# droppings and anything copied in from a real config directory — credentials,
# transcripts, prompt history — from being committed by accident.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!CLAUDE.md
!RTK.md
!statusline.sh
!settings.json
!hooks/
!hooks/**
# Skills: allowlist individually. Most under skills/ are third-party with no
# license recorded, and this repo is meant to be publishable — vendoring
# someone else's unlicensed work is not ours to redistribute.
!skills/
skills/**
!skills/ui-styling/
!skills/ui-styling/**
!templates/
!templates/**
!install.sh
!check.sh
!.githooks/
!.githooks/**
!PRACTICES.md
!LICENSE
!.github/
!.github/**
!tests/
!tests/check-security.sh
!output-styles/
!output-styles/**
